# Optional. heim's primary config is `heim.toml` (see heim.toml.example or run
# `heim init`). You normally do NOT need a .env.
#
# Use this only for per-machine overrides of heim.toml, or for secrets you'd
# rather keep out of a committed file. A HEIM_* env var (including one set here)
# overrides heim.toml's top-level keys.

# Override the library location for this machine (e.g. a different mount on Linux).
# HEIM_LIBRARY_ROOT=/mnt/llm/Library

# Hugging Face token for gated/private repos (falls back to `hf login`).
# HEIM_HF_TOKEN=hf_...
